Examples::

.. tab:: Freeform

   .. code-block:: dakota

       method,
         approximate_control_variate acv_mf
           solver_metric norm_estimator_variance norm_order = 2
           solution_mode  online_pilot
           pilot_samples = 50 seed = 8674132
           max_function_evaluations = 500

